      "text_helper": "Section 16.6.6 \"EXTI privilege configuration register (EXTI_PRIVCFGR1)\" in chapter 16 (Extended interrupts and event controller (EXTI)), RM0522 Rev 1, page 455.",
      "section_content": "Address offset: 0x018\nReset value: 0x0000 0000\nThis register provides privileged write access protection. An unprivileged read returns the\nregister data.\nContains only register bits for privilege capable input events.\nBits 31:0 PRIVx: Privilege enable on event input x (x = 31 to 0)\n0: Event privilege disabled (unprivileged)\n1: Event privilege enabled (privileged)",
